Sphere: elemental, conjuration
Range: 20 meters
Duration: 2 turns
Casting Time: 1 round
Area of Effect: special
Saving Throw: none

This spell summons the Elemental Prince Zaaman Rul. He serves the preacher for 2 turns.~

@295 = ~Fire Lord~
@296 = ~Requirement: ability to summon Zaaman Rul

Fire Lord
The preacher who can command Zaaman Rul, Prince of Fire, gains the respect of many fire creatures. His growing power and reputation establish him as a Fire Lord and win him many allies.
The Fire Lord can now charm any fire creature, including elementals, salamanders, djinn, efreet and mephits.
He no longer needs to touch them, and they cannot resist this power. He also gains two additional daily uses.
Several summoning spells also change to reflect his new status:
Elemental Prince Summoning now allows him to summon the archomental Imix.
Call Fire Servant allows him to summon a broader range of creatures from the Elemental Plane.
Animal Summoning I, II and III now summon fire creatures, which answer his call more readily than animals.
He also gains the ability to control swarms of fireflies.~
@2961 = ~Control Fire Creature~
